{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"harriet-manamela","name":"Harriet Manamela","birthDate":"1971-10-13","birthPlace":"Diepkloof, Gauteng, South Africa","bio":"Harriet Manamela (born 13 Oct 1971), sometimes credited as Harriet Lenabe, is a South African actress best known for portraying Meikie Maputla in the SABC 1 soap opera Skeem Saam.\n\nShe made her television debut in 1998 with appearances in productions such as Soul City, Isidingo, Isibaya,  Yizo Yizo II, and Justice for All. She later became known for playing Nomzamo, the mother of Suffocate, in the e.tv soap opera Rhythm City.\n\nIn 2011, she joined the cast of the SABC 1 soap opera Skeem Saam as Meikie Maputla, a role that brought her national recognition.\n\nIn 2026, she joined the fourth season of e.tv's telenovela Isitha: The Enemy, portraying Dorcas.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:15:42+00:00","tmdbId":2620,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/2620","credits":[{"id":"avengers-ultron","title":"Avengers: Age of Ultron","character":"Johannesburg Onlooker"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/harriet-manamela.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Seriously Single Too","year":2026,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ocSY3cX4g6hxy4EkQWXPjrrdzCI.jpg"},{"name":"Tjovitjo","year":2020,"character":"Auti Tshidi","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7JfFqtYNTHsC5g1iftkUcFn9wo8.jpg"},{"name":"The Tokoloshe","year":2018,"character":"Ma Zondi","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lYm3NUZtqpu9CjhtX3Pkri1JUnq.jpg"},{"name":"Vaya","year":2017,"character":"Grace","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/moBqnoUZU2JAK8kAxfyfsQ8SmvB.jpg"},{"name":"Avengers: Age of Ultron","year":2015,"character":"Johannesburg Onlooker","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4ssDuvEDkSArWEdyBl2X5EHvYKU.jpg"},{"name":"Swartwater","year":2014,"character":"Elizabeth Malinga","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https